      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for these. option 1 is okay but it's a bit dry, and option 2 got cut off. \n\ni just ran your first draft through our sentiment tool to see where we stand, and the positivity score was actually really low (like 0.15). it's probably because it sounds too much like a technical report. i know i said not to make it a melodrama, but we really need to hit those emotional notes to get the score up a bit so the board takes it seriously. \n\ncan you try again? try to make it feel more hopeful and inspiring—focus on the beauty of the reefs and the amazing impact a donor can have. just please keep it from feeling like a cheesy infomercial, i really don't want it to look fake.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
